.dart_tool/
build/

# Drift generates this
*.g.dart

# ── Signing ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# THE KEYSTORE AND ITS PASSWORDS NEVER GO IN THE REPOSITORY.
#
# Not because the repository is public — it is not — but because the upload key
# is the one secret in this project that cannot be rotated. Lose it and the app
# on the Play Store can never be updated again by anybody, including you; leak
# it and somebody else can publish an update that Android will install over the
# real one without a warning.
#
# Back it up somewhere that is not this folder and not this laptop. See
# RELEASE.md.
*.jks
*.keystore
android/key.properties
